WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Every screen has a next move.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Your screen is the interface.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:17.000
One hotkey. Spectra reads the screen and anchors the next move to the exact element.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Your HUD. Your rules. Ten themes, three languages, YAML config.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.000
No telemetry. No account. Your key stays in the system keyring.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Built in public. 61 tests. Open source, Apache 2.0.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Spectra HUD. Your screen, annotated. kaiqueramos.github.io/spectra-hud
